\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\title{A double cover of the signed coordinate changes}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{A quarter-turn of two directions moves an edge field as in
\ref{fdip-016J}. A different field can carry operators representing
those directions. What happens when a change of coordinates acts
by conjugating the operators?}

\p{Several operators can induce the same change of directions.
How many choices occur in the group generated by the elementary
lifts, and what distinguishes their actions on a momentum block?}

